  "concerns": [],
  "instructions": {
    "pre_release": [],
    "post_release": []
  }
}
```

Or if issues found:

```json
{
  "releasable": false,
  "verdict": "Needs attention before release",
  "concerns": [
    "Found TODO comment in src/foo.ts",
    "Tests failing in commands/drive.md"
  ],
  "instructions": {
    "pre_release": ["Fix failing tests", "Remove TODO comments"],
    "post_release": []
  }
}
```

